  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Belle Mere – Your 30A Beach Escape by Ed Walline! 🌴☀️<br><br>If you’re dreaming of a beach vacation where you can park the car and forget about it, Belle Mere is exactly what you’ve been looking for. This stylish 4-bedroom coastal home is perfectly positioned just off 393, less than two blocks from Ed Walline Regional Beach Access and the popular Gulf Place area. Walk, bike, or take the included golf cart to the beach, shops, and restaurants—it’s all right at your fingertips.<br><br>At Gulf Place, you’ll find:<br><br>Family-friendly restaurants like Pizza by the Sea, The Perfect Pig, and Shunk Gulley<br><br>A huge central lawn where the kids can run and play<br><br>Live music, boutique shopping, and a relaxed, beachy vibe<br><br>Bright, Airy & Designed for Together Time<br><br>Step into a modern, beach-chic retreat with bright whites, coastal accents, and an open layout perfect for gathering.<br><br>The bright white kitchen overlooks the living area, so the conversation never stops—whether you’re cooking dinner, pouring drinks, or packing beach snacks.<br><br>Dining for 8 at the table, plus additional seating at the kitchen island.<br><br>Head out to the patio for al fresco dining after a day in the sun.<br><br>Main Level Layout:<br><br>Kitchen<br><br>Living & dining areas<br><br>Half bath<br><br>Laundry room<br><br>First-floor King bedroom with sitting area, TV, and ensuite bath<br><br>Private Pool, Fire Pit & Outdoor Fun 🌊🔥<br><br>After a day on the sugar-white sands and emerald waters of the Gulf, come home and cool off in your private pool.<br><br>Outside you’ll enjoy:<br><br>Sparkling private pool<br><br>Lounge chairs and patio seating<br><br>Large gas grill for effortless outdoor feasts<br><br>Fire pit with additional seating – perfect for s’mores, stargazing, and evening hangs<br><br>NOW WITH GOLF CART INCLUDED – cruise to the beach, Gulf Place, or just explore 30A in style.<br><br>Comfortable Sleeping for 10 Guests<br><br>1st Floor:<br><br>Bedroom 1: King Bed<br><br>Ensuite bath with expansive marble vanity and sink<br><br>Large tiled walk-in glass shower<br><br>Separate toilet area<br><br>2nd Floor:<br><br>Bedroom 2: King Bed<br><br>Ensuite bath with tub/shower combo and marble countertop<br><br>Bedroom 3: King Bed<br><br>Ensuite bath with walk-in tile shower and marble countertop<br><br>Bedroom 4: King Bed<br><br>Ensuite bath with expansive marble vanity and sink<br><br>Separate makeup counter<br><br>Walk-in shower<br><br>Bunks on Landing:<br><br>Built-in queen-over-queen bunk beds in the upstairs hallway<br><br>Each bunk has its own TV – a total kid/teen favorite<br><br>Every bedroom has its own streaming TV and private full bath, so no one has to share or wait their turn.<br><br>Total Sleeping Capacity: Sleeps 10<br><br>Booking Policy<br><br>50% Advance Deposit due at time of booking<br><br>Remaining balance due 30 days prior to arrival<br><br>Reservations canceled 30+ days before arrival receive a full refund<br><br>Check-In: 4:00 PM CST<br><br>Check-Out: 10:00 AM CST<br><br>Age Requirement: Must be 25 or older to rent<br><br>Must have 1 adult for every 2 guests under 25<br><br>From coffee on the patio and days spent at Ed Walline to nights by the pool and fire pit, Belle Mere delivers the classic 30A beach experience with all the comforts of home.<br><br>Book your stay today and start counting down the days to your next beach getaway. 🐚🌅",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Relax & Play: Private Pool, Firepit, Outdoor Dining + 4-Seater Golf Cart!"
        }
